{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Avoid a process-global worker baseline.** The preceding test does not wait for its daemon worker to exit after `end_invocation()`. If that worker is included in `base` and then exits while this test starts its two workers, the delta remains 1 and this assertion times out despite both new lanes being healthy. Assert one live worker for each lane by identity instead.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s0_tn","finding_digest":"7b90c28271a8c8d9f8515d4b50f60cd7216f86c585bda2de6030d8a784c40a7c","finding_id":"arf_v1_poimfatrvdent6crlvfvb5qm24","finding_key":"insight/tests/test_export_scheduler.py::test_one_worker_per_exporter::process-global-thread-baseline","identity_key":"insight/tests/test_export_scheduler.py::test_one_worker_per_exporter::process-global-thread-baseline","line":191,"observation_digest":"5ee44fa3522f3b252c3dcdf04b957e8b8242f5fcdc6c3f6a6905a29168319561","observation_id":"aro_v1_l3se7i2sf45sklb5zxyexfl6ro","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/tests/test_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:48:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uset4xdyfd3lpw4wnc4wsyumsl","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"e6f101650c673b6f7e22f734d2003911bdc207de","reviewer":"codex","start_line":186,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_f6bnrcomcwoinf5szokh67xc5y"},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_j3p5mjewvm5ftvoucx5fwma4ck","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:48:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
